add('10','Format view tests','Format all five current view tests with no changes to inputs or assertions, completing the original 45-file reformatting.', ['tests/view/'+p+'.test.mjs' for p in ['icons','program-editor','status-row','terrain-picture','tile-list']],[], 'Run local pinned Prettier on Change paths, `npm run build`, and `node --test "tests/view/*.test.mjs"`. Run `python -B scripts/check_format.py --record .runs/format.jsonl`, ESLint and Ruff checks, and `npm test`. Verify every original covered file and every new covered file passes, with no historic exceptions.','Slice 6; Slice 7; Slice 8; Slice 9; settlement 19')
add('11','Write general and four kind guidelines','Write the five files from the accepted task and product foundation through the coding template author route. Include exact accepted tables/statuses, index, all settled checks, existing kind rules, required short whole-file good/bad cases and the one test example; retain the fourteen Ruff examples and all accepted deferrals. Do not repeat the exemplar comparison audit or add architecture rules.', ['guidelines/coding.md','guidelines/coding-content-data.md','guidelines/coding-simulation-module.md','guidelines/coding-browser-module.md','guidelines/coding-http-application.md'],['.agents/skills/the-way-maintain-coding-guidelines/SKILL.md','.the-way/product-guidelines/coding/SKILL.md','.the-way/product-guidelines/coding/template.md','.the-way/product-guidelines/template.md','src/browser/sim/data/resources.ts','src/browser/sim/game.ts','src/browser/view/status-row.ts','src/server/app.ts','tests/sim/time.test.mjs'], 'Run `python -B .the-way/product-guidelines/form_check.py --record .runs/guidelines-form.jsonl` and `python -B .the-way/product-guidelines/form_check.py --merge-onto '+base+' --record .runs/guidelines-reference.jsonl`. An independent reviewer applies every rule good/bad pair in a scratch worktree and also invents a separate deliberate break for every new/changed invariant check. Stage named new files for path checks; never commit cycle files.','All preceding slices; settlements 1-22')
add('12','Point agent instructions at completed guidelines','Use maintain-instruction-files to add the one conditional pointer outside the installer block in root AGENTS.md, with no duplicate tool commands or kind paths. CLAUDE.md already imports AGENTS.md and requires no second instruction.', ['AGENTS.md'],['CLAUDE.md','.the-way/instruction-files/principles.md','.the-way/instruction-files/check_instructions.py'], 'Run `python -B .the-way/instruction-files/check_instructions.py`; run `python -B .the-way/gate/run_tests.py tests/agent_workflow --record .runs/agent-workflow.jsonl` and both guideline checks. Apply the personal maintain-instruction-files method during execution; its external path is a method input, not a product write.','Slice 11; settlements 21, 22')
